    "title": "Figure 4 - Premade Intermediate Files",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14537494",
    "publication_date": "2024-12-20",
    "description": "<p><strong><em>These are premade intermediate files used in the Giotto Suite Manuscript Figure 4&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/drieslab/Giotto_Suite_manuscript/blob/main/scripts/Figure_4.R\">scripts</a></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Contents:</strong></p>\n<p><code>segmentation_polygons.json</code> - {baysor 0.5.2} segmentation GeometryCollection</p>\n<p><code>cellpose.tiff</code> - {cellpose 3.1.0} segmentation mask</p>\n<p><code>stardist.tiff</code> - {stardist 0.9.1} segmentation mask</p>\n<p><code>mesmer.tiff</code> - {deepcell 0.12.10}, {deepcell-toolbox 0.12.1}, {deepcell-tracking 0.6.5} segmentation mask</p>\n<p><code>zoomext.csv</code> - extent information for a zoomed in ROI</p>\n<p><code>IF_cropped.tif</code>, <code>IF_cropped.tif.aux.xml</code> - Cropped ROI of IF image (used in segmentation)</p>",
